      "Uses the frozen report input manifest SHA-256 ba8d07576901a89a573a76cdd493ffa13b2299218e1c530639805d5371859b70. The retained result values are the published source-qualified reference view; original-reference statistics are separate.": "采用报告冻结输入清单 SHA-256 ba8d07576901a89a573a76cdd493ffa13b2299218e1c530639805d5371859b70。保留的结果值采用已发布的来源核验参考口径，原始参考统计单独保留。",
      "The public summary keeps quoted pricing ranges and software-only charges separate from total spend. Missing native model-usage receipts do not mean zero model cost.": "公开摘要分别保留报价范围和软件费用，不把它们当作实际总支出。缺少原生模型用量回执不等于模型费用为零。",
      "Dataset and scorer artifacts are identified by hashes in the public report. Source-qualified annotations and original reference labels must not be mixed within one comparison.": "公开报告用哈希标识数据与评分产物，同一组比较不混用来源核验标注和原始参考。",
